# Source deploy only needs the image build inputs. No .git or local credentials.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!.gcloudignore
!requirements.txt
!requirements.lock
!seo_audit/
!seo_audit/**
!app/
!app/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env*
**/credentials*.json
**/*-credentials.json
**/service-account*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
